>2006</year><volume>55</volume><fpage>844</fpage><lpage>848</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="B20"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Shin</surname><given-names>HR</given-names></name><name><surname>Franceschi</surname><given-names>s</given-names></name><name><surname>Vaccarella</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Roh</surname><given-names>JW</given-names></name><name><surname>Ju</surname><given-names>YH</given-names></name><name><surname>Oh</surname><given-names>JK</given-names></name><name><surname>Kong</surname><given-names>HJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Rha</surname><given-names>SH</given-names></name><name><surname>Jung</surname><given-names>SI</given-names></name><name><surname>Kin</surname><given-names>JL</given-names></name><name><surname>Jung</surname><given-names>KY</given-names></name><name><surname>nab Doorn</surname><given-names>LJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Quint</surname><given-names>W</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Age-specific prevalence of infection with HSV-2 in urban areas of Korea</article-title><source>22nd NRL Workshop on Serology, Australia Melbourne</source><year>2006</year><volume>10</volume><fpage>16</fpage><lpage>19</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="B21"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Espinoza</surname><given-names>Lorena MPH</given-names></name><name><surname>Irene Hall</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Hardnett</surname><given-names>Felicia</given-names></name><name><surname>Selik</surname><given-names>RichardM</given-names></name><name><surname>Ling</surname><given-names>Qiang</given-names></name><name><surname>Lee</surname><given-names>LisaM</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Characteristics of Persons with Heterosexually acquired HIV infection, United States 1999&#x02013;2004</article-title><source>American Journal of Public Hea